{"id":286519,"title":"02 | 内容综述","content":"本课程旨在通过核心概念讲解与实战开发，系统掌握 Rust 语言及其异步编程体系。课程共七章，前兩章梳理语法基础并构建核心概念模型，帮助学习者理解 Rust 与其他语言的异同及所有权等关键机制。第三章深入剖析异步编程底层原理，解析 Async、Future 及 Tokio 等运行时库的工作机制。第四、五章为课程核心，从零构建轻量级异步 Web 框架：先实现 TCP 服务、路由匹配、中间件及验证器等骨架，再扩展 HTTP 客户端、TLS、WebSocket、Redis 等功能，以此掌握抽象技巧与设计模式。第六章结合 Rust 前端框架（基于 WebAssembly）开发 Todo List 应用，在实战中验证框架能力并发现改进点。第七章总结学习心得并探讨框架优化方向。需注意的是，该框架基于 Stable 与 Safe Rust 构建，主要服务于教学目的，虽可用于生产环境，但针对特定场景可能需进一步性能优化。整套课程以实战驱动理论，帮助开发者建立完整的 Rust 异步编程知识体系与工程实践能力。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":248935,"user_name":"My dream","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1077733,"ip_address":"","ucode":"2FEFB344230C17","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/71/e5/bcdc382a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1600383519,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100060601,"comment_content":"张老师，你讲的课程是基于rust的哪个版本来讲的，是1. 45吗？","like_count":3},{"had_liked":false,"id":378138,"user_name":"罗青","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1111544,"ip_address":"山东","ucode":"82CE5E5332130C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/f5/f8/6d1974f6.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1689815113,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100060601,"comment_content":"是不是第五第六章没有","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":281877,"user_name":"Geek_dd3623","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2126054,"ip_address":"","ucode":"425D85E5DFFC85","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLg04lnicnUNWXFF2yyk7neSxl7fuI5LBZRYFRDEM8qhyPC3bDwFhz6FLx2NiaGFqa8ZpAz33Thj3cg/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1614932131,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100060601,"comment_content":"rust 前端框架是 Yew 吧","like_count":0}]}